{"id":"19dd1f8599ff0195","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-type-index.md","title":"类型索引","display":"df-type-index — 类型索引","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-type-index","aliases":["91-df-type-index"],"display":"df-type-index — 类型索引","depends_on":["[[91-df-typed-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-type-index"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-type-index</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-type-index — 类型索引"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7a7ac1c668908eae\" href=\"?note=7a7ac1c668908eae\" title=\"91-df-typed-language\">91-df-typed-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-type-index-—-类型索引-$n$\">df-type-index — 类型索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}\\)</span> (类型化语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7a7ac1c668908eae\" href=\"?note=7a7ac1c668908eae\" title=\"91-df-typed-language\">91-df-typed-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L}^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L}^{1}\\)</span> (语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 的一元谓词符号集,\nsee <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a7ac1c668908eae\" href=\"?note=7a7ac1c668908eae\" title=\"91-df-typed-language\">91-df-typed-language</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}type\\text{-}index}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{idx}:\\{T^n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{idx}(T^n)\\coloneqq n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}type\\text{-}index}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{idx}:\\{T^n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{idx}(T^n)\\coloneqq n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由这些谓词符号两两不同，该函数良定义；并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall k,n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\bigl(T^k\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}^{1}\n\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{idx}(T^k)&lt;n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall k,n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\bigl(T^k\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}^{1}\n\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{idx}(T^k)&lt;n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> : 类型索引（真理谓词的层次编号）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}\\)</span> : 第n层类型化语言</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：类型索引<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>标识真理谓词的层次位置。通常只为\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T^n\">\\(\\mathcal L_T^n\\)</span> 公式给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span> 配置真理公理；这是理论层约束，不是\n一元谓词的纯句法形成规则。</p>\n<p>分层机制：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^0\">\\(T^0\\)</span> 的预期真理公理以基础语言句子为对象</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^1\">\\(T^1\\)</span> 的预期真理公理以\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0 \\cup \\{T^0\\}\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0 \\cup \\{T^0\\}\\)</span> 句子为对象</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span> 的预期真理公理以\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0 \\cup \\{T^k : k &lt; n\\}\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0 \\cup \\{T^k : k &lt; n\\}\\)</span> 的句子为对象</li>\n</ul>\n<p>作用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不给同层或更高层句子配置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span> 的真理双条件式</li>\n<li>阻断产生说谎者矛盾所需的同层反引用原则</li>\n<li>为相对一致性/保守性证明提供分层结构；具体每层是否对 PA 保守还取决于\n所加真理公理和归纳模式，不能由索引句法单独推出</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-type-index-—-类型索引-$n$","text":"df-type-index — 类型索引 $n$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-typed-language","status":"resolved","id":"7a7ac1c668908eae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-typed-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-typed-language","status":"resolved","id":"7a7ac1c668908eae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}$ (类型化语言, see [[91-df-typed-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-typed-language","status":"resolved","id":"7a7ac1c668908eae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L}^{1}$ (语言 $\\mathcal L$ 的一元谓词符号集,\nsee [[91-df-typed-language]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L}^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}type\\text{-}index}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{idx}:\\{T^n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{idx}(T^n)\\coloneqq n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall k,n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\bigl(T^k\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}^{1}\n\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{idx}(T^k)<n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T^n","display":false},{"tex":"T^n","display":false},{"tex":"T^0","display":false},{"tex":"T^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_0 \\cup \\{T^0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_0 \\cup \\{T^k : k < n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T^n","display":false}],"bytes":1735,"backlinks":[{"id":"297207ea3fca7fff","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-type-index]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-type-index]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-induction.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-logic.md]]\n[[91-